### Key Fixes Applied

1. **Service Implementation Casting** (src/eShopModern.Application/Services/CatalogService.cs)
   - Added `.Cast<object>()` calls to maintain interface contract while enabling type safety
   - Fixed all service method implementations

2. **Web Layer Type Safety** (src/eShopModern.Web/Pages/Index.cshtml.cs)
